{"id":"a1.u09","level":"A1","order":9,"title":{"en":"Right now","ru":"Прямо сейчас"},"description":"Рассказываем, что происходит прямо сейчас: действия, погода, звонок другу. Present Continuous, вопросы What are you doing? и разница с Present Simple.","goals":["Могу сказать, что делаю или делает человек прямо сейчас: I am cooking. She is walking.","Могу сказать «не»: I am not working. He isn't sleeping.","Могу спросить: What are you doing? Is it raining?","Могу сказать о погоде: It is sunny and warm.","Могу выбрать между Present Simple и Present Continuous.","Могу написать короткий текст о том, что происходит вокруг."],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous","a1.continuous-questions","a1.simple-vs-continuous"],"troubles":["tenses","word-order"],"texts":[{"id":"a1.u09.call","kind":"dialogue","genre":"conversation","title":{"en":"A phone call","ru":"Телефонный разговор"},"speakers":[{"id":"anna","name":"Anna","voice":"female"},{"id":"tom","name":"Tom","voice":"male"}],"lines":[{"speaker":"anna","en":"Hello, Tom! What are you doing?","ru":"Привет, Том! Что ты делаешь?"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"I am cooking dinner. And you?","ru":"Я готовлю ужин. А ты?"},{"speaker":"anna","en":"I am walking in the park. It is sunny and warm.","ru":"Я гуляю в парке. Солнечно и тепло."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Is your sister with you?","ru":"Твоя сестра с тобой?"},{"speaker":"anna","en":"Yes, she is. She is talking on the phone.","ru":"Да. Она разговаривает по телефону."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Is it raining?","ru":"Дождь идёт?"},{"speaker":"anna","en":"No, it isn't. We are sitting and listening to music.","ru":"Нет. Мы сидим и слушаем музыку."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"OK. I am busy now. Call me tomorrow.","ru":"Хорошо. Я сейчас занят. Позвони мне завтра."}],"glossary":[]},{"id":"a1.u09.park","kind":"reading","genre":"article","title":{"en":"Saturday in the park","ru":"Суббота в парке"},"speakers":[],"lines":[{"en":"It is Saturday afternoon. The weather is sunny and warm, and there are many people in the park.","ru":"Сейчас субботний день. Погода солнечная и тёплая, и в парке много людей."},{"en":"The children are playing in the garden. A man is sitting and reading a newspaper. Two girls are dancing and singing. A woman is running.","ru":"Дети играют в саду. Мужчина сидит и читает газету. Две девочки танцуют и поют. Женщина бежит."},{"en":"I am not working today. I am sitting with my friend and drinking coffee. We are listening to music.","ru":"Сегодня я не работаю. Я сижу с другом и пью кофе. Мы слушаем музыку."}],"glossary":[]}],"lessons":[{"id":"a1.u09.l01","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Что люди делают","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e01","hint":"Sit и stand отличаются одной буквой.","explanation":"Sit — сидеть, stand — стоять, run — бегать, wait — ждать, dance — танцевать.","difficulty":1,"words":["sit","stand","run","wait","dance"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"sit","ru":"сидеть"},{"en":"stand","ru":"стоять"},{"en":"run","ru":"бегать"},{"en":"wait","ru":"ждать"},{"en":"dance","ru":"танцевать"}]},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e02","hint":"Talk и speak близки по смыслу.","explanation":"Look — смотреть, listen — слушать, talk — разговаривать, speak — говорить, write — писать.","difficulty":1,"words":["look","listen","talk","speak","write"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"look","ru":"смотреть"},{"en":"listen","ru":"слушать"},{"en":"talk","ru":"разговаривать"},{"en":"speak","ru":"говорить"},{"en":"write","ru":"писать"}]},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e03","hint":"Sing и song — родственные слова.","explanation":"Sing — петь, song — песня, music — музыка, now — сейчас, busy — занятой.","difficulty":1,"words":["now","sing","music","song","busy"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"sing","ru":"петь"},{"en":"song","ru":"песня"},{"en":"music","ru":"музыка"},{"en":"now","ru":"сейчас"},{"en":"busy","ru":"занятой"}]},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e04","hint":"Слушают ушами.","explanation":"Listen [ˈlɪsən] — «слушать». Буква t не читается.","difficulty":1,"words":["look","listen","wait"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"слушать","options":["listen","look","wait"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e05","hint":"Это делают ручкой.","explanation":"Write [raɪt] — «писать». Read — «читать».","difficulty":1,"words":["write"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"писать","options":["write","read","walk"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e06","hint":"Это про время.","explanation":"Right now — «прямо сейчас». Right бывает ещё «справа», «направо».","difficulty":1,"words":["now","right-now"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"right now","options":["прямо сейчас","справа","каждый день"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e07","hint":"Предлог to подсказывает глагол.","explanation":"I listen to music. Listen to — «слушать».","difficulty":1,"words":["look","listen","speak","music"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ to music in the evening.","translation":"Вечером я слушаю музыку.","answers":[["listen"]],"options":["listen","look","speak"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e08","hint":"Предлог at подсказывает глагол.","explanation":"Please look at the map. Look at — «смотреть на».","difficulty":1,"words":["look","listen","wait"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Please ___ at the map.","translation":"Пожалуйста, посмотрите на карту.","answers":[["look"]],"options":["look","listen","wait"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e09","hint":"Язык — глагол для языка.","explanation":"I speak English and Russian. Для языка — speak.","difficulty":1,"words":["talk","speak","write"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ English and Russian.","translation":"Я говорю по-английски и по-русски.","answers":[["speak"]],"options":["speak","talk","write"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e10","hint":"Первый звук — [w].","explanation":"I am waiting — «я жду». Writing [ˈraɪtɪŋ] — «пишу».","difficulty":1,"words":["write","wait"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"I am waiting.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["I am waiting.","I am writing.","I am walking."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e11","hint":"Четыре слова.","explanation":"Two girls are singing — «две девочки поют».","difficulty":1,"words":["sing"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"Two girls are singing.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e12","hint":"Пять букв.","explanation":"Music [ˈmjuːzɪk] — «музыка».","difficulty":1,"words":["music"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"музыка","answers":["music"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e13","hint":"В одном слове гласный короткий.","explanation":"Sit [sɪt] — «сидеть», seat [siːt] — «место». Звуки отличаются длиной.","difficulty":1,"words":["sit"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"minimal_pair","pair":[{"en":"sit","ipa":"sɪt"},{"en":"seat","ipa":"siːt"}],"say":0},{"id":"a1.u09.l01.e14","hint":"Два действия подряд.","explanation":"Sitting [ˈsɪtɪŋ], listening [ˈlɪsənɪŋ]: окончание -ing читается [ɪŋ].","difficulty":1,"words":["listen","sit","music"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"I am sitting and listening to music."}]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Погода","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e01","hint":"Warm и cold — противоположные.","explanation":"Sunny — солнечный, cloudy — облачный, windy — ветреный, warm — тёплый, cold — холодный.","difficulty":1,"words":["sunny","cloudy","windy","warm"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"sunny","ru":"солнечный"},{"en":"cloudy","ru":"облачный"},{"en":"windy","ru":"ветреный"},{"en":"warm","ru":"тёплый"},{"en":"cold","ru":"холодный"}]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e02","hint":"Три слова — про осадки и небо.","explanation":"Rain — дождь, snow — снег, weather — погода, outside — на улице, sun — солнце.","difficulty":1,"words":["weather","rain#verb","snow","outside"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"rain","ru":"дождь"},{"en":"snow","ru":"снег"},{"en":"weather","ru":"погода"},{"en":"outside","ru":"на улице"},{"en":"sun","ru":"солнце"}]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e03","hint":"На небе нет облаков.","explanation":"Sunny — «солнечный»: [ˈsʌni].","difficulty":1,"words":["sunny"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"sunny","distractors":["cloudy","windy"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e04","hint":"Небо серое.","explanation":"Cloudy — «облачный»: [ˈklaʊdi].","difficulty":1,"words":["cloudy"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"cloudy","distractors":["sunny","windy"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e05","hint":"Зимой нужна тёплая одежда.","explanation":"The weather is cold. I want a coat. Cold — «холодный».","difficulty":1,"words":["weather","sunny","warm"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"The weather is ___. I want a coat.","translation":"Холодная погода. Я хочу пальто.","answers":[["cold"]],"options":["cold","warm","sunny"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e06","hint":"Пальто не нужно.","explanation":"It is warm today. Warm — «тёплый».","difficulty":1,"words":["windy","warm"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"It is ___ today. I wear a shirt.","translation":"Сегодня тепло. Я надеваю рубашку.","answers":[["warm"]],"options":["warm","cold","windy"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e07","hint":"Зонт нужен при дожде.","explanation":"It is raining now. После is — глагол с -ing.","difficulty":1,"words":["now","sunny","rain#verb","snow"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"It is ___ now. I have an umbrella.","translation":"Сейчас идёт дождь. У меня есть зонт.","answers":[["raining"]],"options":["raining","sunny","snow"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e08","hint":"Snow — зимний снег.","explanation":"It is snowing — «идёт снег». Snow — снег.","difficulty":1,"words":["snow"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"It is snowing.","options":["Идёт снег.","Идёт дождь.","Ветрено."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e09","hint":"Начинается с What.","explanation":"What is the weather like? — «Какая погода?». Здесь like значит «какой», а не «нравится».","difficulty":1,"words":["weather"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["false-friends"],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"Какая погода?","options":["What is the weather like?","Where is the weather?","How old is the weather?"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e10","hint":"Два слова на -y.","explanation":"It is cloudy and windy — «облачно и ветрено».","difficulty":1,"words":["sunny","cloudy","windy","warm"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"It is cloudy and windy.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["It is cloudy and windy.","It is sunny and warm.","It is cold and windy."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e11","hint":"Пять слов.","explanation":"It is sunny and warm — «солнечно и тепло».","difficulty":1,"words":["sunny","warm"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"It is sunny and warm.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e12","hint":"Пять букв.","explanation":"Windy [ˈwɪndi] — «ветреный».","difficulty":1,"words":["windy"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"ветреный","answers":["windy"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e13","hint":"Ударение на втором слоге.","explanation":"out-SIDE — ударение на второй слог.","difficulty":1,"words":["outside"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"word_stress","word":"outside","syllables":["out","side"],"stress":1},{"id":"a1.u09.l02.e14","hint":"It is… и два слова про погоду.","explanation":"Ответ: It is sunny and warm.","difficulty":3,"words":["weather","sunny","windy","warm"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"What is the weather like today?","questionRu":"Какая сегодня погода? Ответьте: It is sunny. или It is cold and windy.","keywords":[["\\bit is\\b","\\bit's\\b"],["\\b(sunny|cloudy|windy|warm|cold|raining|snowing|hot)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["It is sunny and warm.","It is cold and windy."]}]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03","kind":"grammar","title":"Что происходит сейчас","grammar":"a1.present-continuous","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e01","hint":"С I — особая форма.","explanation":"I am cooking dinner now. С I — am.","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ cooking dinner now.","translation":"Я сейчас готовлю ужин.","answers":[["am"]],"options":["am","is","are"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e02","hint":"С she — коротко.","explanation":"She is walking in the park. С she — is.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ walking in the park.","translation":"Она гуляет в парке.","answers":[["is"]],"options":["is","am","are"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e03","hint":"О нескольких людях.","explanation":"They are playing in the garden. С they — are.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"They ___ playing in the garden.","translation":"Они играют в саду.","answers":[["are"]],"options":["are","is","am"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e04","hint":"После is — форма на -ing.","explanation":"He is reading a book. После is — глагол с -ing.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He is ___ a book.","translation":"Он читает книгу.","answers":[["reading"]],"options":["reading","reads","read"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e05","hint":"Согласная удваивается.","explanation":"Правильно: A woman is running in the park. Run → running.","difficulty":1,"words":["run"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"A woman is ___ in the park.","translation":"Женщина бегает в парке.","answers":[["running"]],"options":["running","runing","runs"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e06","hint":"Конечную e убираем.","explanation":"We are writing English. Write → writing: e убирается.","difficulty":1,"words":["write"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"We are ___ English.","translation":"Мы пишем по-английски.","answers":[["writing"]],"options":["writing","writeing","write"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e07","hint":"Конечную e убираем.","explanation":"Правильно: The girls are dancing and singing. Dance → dancing.","difficulty":1,"words":["sing","dance"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"The girls are ___ and singing.","translation":"Девочки танцуют и поют.","answers":[["dancing"]],"options":["dancing","danceing","dance"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e08","hint":"После not — форма на -ing.","explanation":"I am not working now. Отрицание — am not + глагол с -ing.","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I am not ___ now.","translation":"Сейчас я не работаю.","answers":[["working"]],"options":["working","work","works"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e09","hint":"С he — отрицание be.","explanation":"He isn't sleeping. Isn't — сокращение от is not.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He ___ sleeping.","translation":"Он не спит.","answers":[["isn't","is not"]],"options":["isn't","doesn't","aren't"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e10","hint":"Пропущено слово.","explanation":"I am cooking dinner now. Нужен am.","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"error_correction","text":"I cooking dinner now.","wrong":"I cooking","correction":"I am cooking","options":["I am cooking","I cook","I is cooking"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e11","hint":"После is — форма на -ing.","explanation":"Правильно: She is walking in the park.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"She is walk in the park.","wrong":"walk","correction":"walking","options":["walking","walks","walked"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e12","hint":"Согласная удваивается.","explanation":"He is running. Одна гласная и одна согласная — согласная удваивается.","difficulty":1,"words":["run"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"He is runing.","wrong":"runing","correction":"running","options":["running","runs","run"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e13","hint":"Два глагола с -ing.","explanation":"We are sitting and listening to music. Listen to — «слушать».","difficulty":2,"words":["listen","sit","music"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Мы сидим и слушаем музыку.","answer":"We are sitting and listening to music.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["is","listen"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e14","hint":"На телефоне — on the phone.","explanation":"Правильно: She is talking on the phone now.","difficulty":2,"words":["now","talk"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Она сейчас разговаривает по телефону.","answers":["She is talking on the phone now.","She is talking on the phone."]},{"id":"a1.u09.l03.e15","hint":"Две части.","explanation":"Am cooking — [æm ˈkʊkɪŋ]: ударение на глаголе.","difficulty":1,"words":["sit"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"I am cooking dinner and she is sitting at the table."}]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04","kind":"grammar","title":"Что вы делаете?","grammar":"a1.continuous-questions","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e01","hint":"Вопрос с you.","explanation":"Are you working now? С you — are.","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ you working now?","translation":"Вы сейчас работаете?","answers":[["Are"]],"options":["Are","Do","Is"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e02","hint":"Вопрос с she.","explanation":"Is she sleeping? С she — is.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ she sleeping?","translation":"Она спит?","answers":[["Is"]],"options":["Is","Are","Does"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e03","hint":"После are — форма на -ing.","explanation":"What are you doing? Doing — форма глагола do с -ing.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"What are you ___?","translation":"Что вы делаете?","answers":[["doing"]],"options":["doing","do","does"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e04","hint":"О нескольких людях.","explanation":"Правильно: Where are they walking?","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Where ___ they walking?","translation":"Где они гуляют?","answers":[["are"]],"options":["are","is","do"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e05","hint":"Короткий отрицательный ответ.","explanation":"No, it isn't. Короткий ответ повторяет be.","difficulty":1,"words":["rain#verb"],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Is it raining? — No, it ___.","translation":"Идёт дождь? — Нет.","answers":[["isn't","is not"]],"options":["isn't","doesn't","don't"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e06","hint":"Ответ с I.","explanation":"Yes, I am. После yes be не сокращается.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Are you walking? — Yes, I ___.","translation":"Вы гуляете? — Да.","answers":[["am"]],"options":["am","do","are"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e07","hint":"Порядок слов нужно поменять.","explanation":"Are you working? Be выходит перед подлежащим.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"You are working?","wrong":"You are","correction":"Are you","options":["Are you","Do you","Is you"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e08","hint":"После what сразу be.","explanation":"Правильно: What are you doing?","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"What you are doing?","wrong":"you are","correction":"are you","options":["are you","do you","is you"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e09","hint":"После are — форма на -ing.","explanation":"Правильно: Are you working now?","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"Are you work now?","wrong":"work","correction":"working","options":["working","works","worked"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e10","hint":"Образец: What + is + he.","explanation":"Правильно: What is he cooking?","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Что он готовит?","answer":"What is he cooking?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["does","are"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e11","hint":"Начните с Is.","explanation":"Правильно: Is it raining?","difficulty":1,"words":["rain#verb"],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Идёт ли дождь?","answer":"Is it raining?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["Are","rain"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e12","hint":"Три слова и doing.","explanation":"Правильно: What are you doing?","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Что вы делаете?","answers":["What are you doing?"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e13","hint":"Образец: Is + your sister + listening.","explanation":"Правильно: Is your sister listening to music?","difficulty":2,"words":["listen","music"],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Твоя сестра слушает музыку?","answers":["Is your sister listening to music?"]},{"id":"a1.u09.l04.e14","hint":"Спрашивают про неё.","explanation":"What is she doing? — «Что она сейчас делает?»","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"What is she doing?",