9.l07.e08","hint":"План: где я → погода → что делаю я и другие.","explanation":"Для действий, которые идут сейчас, используйте am, is, are и глагол с -ing. Для отрицания добавляйте not.","difficulty":3,"words":["now","listen","sit","run","write","wait","sing","music","weather","sunny","cloudy","warm","outside"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous","a1.continuous-questions","a1.simple-vs-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"write","task":"Опишите, что происходит вокруг вас прямо сейчас: где вы, какая погода, что делаете вы и другие люди. Например: I am sitting at home. It is sunny. My sister is listening to music.","minWords":30,"maxWords":90,"criteria":[{"id":"ing","label":"Есть глаголы с -ing","patterns":["\\b[a-z]+ing\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"be","label":"Есть am, is или are","patterns":["\\b(am|is|are|isn't|aren't)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"weather","label":"Есть погода","patterns":["\\b(sunny|cloudy|windy|warm|cold|raining|snowing|weather|hot)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"now","label":"Есть now, right now или today","patterns":["\\b(now|right now|today)\\b"],"required":true}],"commonErrors":[{"pattern":"\\bI (cooking|working|sitting|reading|writing|walking|listening)\\b","message":"Перед глаголом с -ing нужно am: I am working."},{"pattern":"\\b(he|she|it) (am|are) [a-z]+ing\\b","message":"С he, she, it — is: she is working."},{"pattern":"\\b(we|you|they) (am|is) [a-z]+ing\\b","message":"С we, you, they — are: they are playing."},{"pattern":"\\b(runing|writeing|sitings|danceing|siting|geting)\\b","message":"Проверьте написание с -ing: running, writing, sitting, dancing."},{"pattern":"\\b(am|is|are) (work|read|play|sit|walk|cook|sleep|run|write|sing|dance)\\b","message":"После am, is, are нужен глагол с -ing: is working, а не is work."}],"samples":["I am sitting at home. It is cloudy and cold today. I am writing my name. My sister is listening to music. She is not working now. My friend is waiting for me outside.","It is Sunday and I am in the park. The weather is sunny and warm. The children are playing. A man is running and a woman is singing. I am drinking coffee now. I am not working today."]}]}],"test":{"passScore":0.8,"exercises":[{"id":"a1.u09.test.e01","hint":"Все слова из первого урока.","explanation":"Listen — слушать, sit — сидеть, wait — ждать, sing — петь, write — писать.","difficulty":1,"words":["listen","sit","write","wait","sing"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"listen","ru":"слушать"},{"en":"sit","ru":"сидеть"},{"en":"wait","ru":"ждать"},{"en":"sing","ru":"петь"},{"en":"write","ru":"писать"}]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e02","hint":"Связано со словом sun.","explanation":"Sunny — «солнечный».","difficulty":1,"words":["sunny","cloudy","windy"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"солнечный","options":["sunny","cloudy","windy"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e03","hint":"С I.","explanation":"Правильно: I am cooking dinner now.","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ cooking dinner now.","translation":"Я сейчас готовлю ужин.","answers":[["am"]],"options":["am","is","are"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e04","hint":"Конечную e убираем.","explanation":"Правильно: They are dancing in the park.","difficulty":1,"words":["dance"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"They are ___ in the park.","translation":"Они танцуют в парке.","answers":[["dancing"]],"options":["dancing","danceing","dance"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e05","hint":"После is — форма на -ing.","explanation":"Правильно: He is reading a newspaper.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He is ___ a newspaper.","translation":"Он читает газету.","answers":[["reading"]],"options":["reading","reads","read"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e06","hint":"Вопрос про she.","explanation":"Правильно: Is she working now?","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ she working now?","translation":"Она сейчас работает?","answers":[["Is"]],"options":["Is","Are","Does"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e07","hint":"Каждый день — привычка.","explanation":"Правильно: I work in an office every day.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.simple-vs-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ in an office every day.","translation":"Я работаю в офисе каждый день.","answers":[["work"]],"options":["work","am working","works"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e08","hint":"После not — форма на -ing.","explanation":"Правильно: She is not sleeping now.","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She is not ___ now.","translation":"Сейчас она не спит.","answers":[["sleeping"]],"options":["sleeping","sleep","sleeps"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e09","hint":"Пропущено слово.","explanation":"Правильно: I am cooking dinner now.","difficulty":1,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"error_correction","text":"I cooking dinner now.","wrong":"I cooking","correction":"I am cooking","options":["I am cooking","I cook","I is cooking"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e10","hint":"Согласная удваивается.","explanation":"Правильно: He is running.","difficulty":1,"words":["run"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"He is runing.","wrong":"runing","correction":"running","options":["running","runs","run"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e11","hint":"Это не действие сейчас.","explanation":"Правильно: I like tea.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.simple-vs-continuous"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I am liking tea.","wrong":"am liking","correction":"like","options":["like","likes","liking"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e12","hint":"Зимнее слово.","explanation":"It is snowing outside — «на улице идёт снег».","difficulty":1,"words":["windy","rain#verb","snow","outside"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"It is snowing outside.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["It is snowing outside.","It is raining outside.","It is windy outside."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e13","hint":"Шесть слов.","explanation":"She is talking on the phone — «она разговаривает по телефону».","difficulty":1,"words":["talk"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"She is talking on the phone.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e14","hint":"Образец: What + are + you.","explanation":"Правильно: What are you doing now?","difficulty":2,"words":["now"],"grammar":["a1.continuous-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Что вы делаете сейчас?","answer":"What are you doing now?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["do","is"]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e15","hint":"Listen to — «слушать».","explanation":"Правильно: I am listening to music now.","difficulty":2,"words":["now","listen","music"],"grammar":["a1.present-continuous"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Сейчас я слушаю музыку.","answers":["I am listening to music now.","Now I am listening to music."]},{"id":"a1.u09.test.e16","hint":"Две части.","explanation":"Sitting [ˈsɪtɪŋ]: окончание -ing читается [ɪŋ].","difficulty":1,"words":["sit","sunny"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"I am sitting in the park and it is sunny."}]},"wordIds":["now","right-now","look","listen","talk","speak","sit","stand","run","write","wait","sing","dance","music","song","weather","sunny","cloudy","windy","warm","rain#verb","snow","outside","busy"]}
